Node ID=20 wise
Text=You are wise to guard your true name, for there is power in its utterance. As I am already bound, you may hear my known names. I am Boruta, the Horned Prince and the Duke of Lies. Names that are likely meaningless to you, but know that they caused great fear among your kind several of your lifetimes ago.
