Node ID=300 Free Demon yourself
Text=Ahhh...the shackles fall away and my power returns! My judgment will be swift and merciless, but to you, I have a debt to repay...
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=301 Pan Free Demon
Text=What a fool! Power corrupts even those you least expect it to.  And you, Scion of Lionheart,  were you a fool to help me escape? Time will tell.  We shall meet again, at a place of my choosing. But for now, I have a debt to repay...
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 1
Text=Have you come to tickle me?
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 2
Text=You'll have to strike me much harder than that to do permanent damage to me.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 3
Text=I haven't had a good lashing like this since the Grand Inquisitor himself visited me last week - and he nearly gave me a scar!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 4
Text=It is my torment to endure the endless scratches and scrapes caused by your pitiful mortal hands. You do realize that you can't truly kill the Daeva of Pain?
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 5
Text=These wounds you inflict are like nourishment, delicious sweet candy for my pain-wracked soul.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 6
Text=Are you familiar with the myth of Prometheus the titan? Poor fool, like me, chained and bound and forced to taste the pain of torture each day. Endlessly. I've grown accustomed to it - I even cherish these moments.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 7
Text=You are a most persistant mortal! By now, most Inquisitors that try to flog me fall down panting with exhaustion.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 attack taunt 8
Text=Your tenacity impresses me, mortal. You have delivered considerable pain and delightful torment to my disfigured body. You are one of the few to earn the respect of the Daeva of Pain.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 taunt final
Text=<Sigh> Mortal, you have exhausted my patience and my witicisms. I really have nothing more to say. Shall we consider this...a stalemate?
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=350 taunt 10
Text=Oh Dark Master, why must I be a training dummy for these witless bags of flesh?
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
